I go outside.
Today is Sunday morning.
The street is very quiet.
This is a nice street.
There are big trees here.
Now there is a gentle breeze.
I walk slowly.
But my mind is in Mexico.
My family is there.
It is night in Mexico now.
Everyone is in my house now.
The voices of my home are in my mind.
I also remember our dog Lola's voice.
I miss them very much.
Even so, Kochi is a beautiful city.
I enjoy this quietness.
I slowly walk again.
